> >
> > Open popcluster, under DataConvert convert the vcf file to a dat file
> >
> > then go project, new project and set up the paramater file. You can also use / manually edit an existing parameter file instead.
> >
> > The output file you want to look at is the Q file, I open it in excel, switch from tab delimited to comma and make a plot from there. You can also view the relevant details and plot stuff in popcluster too.
