Hi Yayan,

Sounds like your names (or loci) have duplicated names and that throws of the function.

Can you try:

indNames(gl) <-  make.unique(indNames(gl))  #add .1 etc to duplicates

and potentially also

locNames(gl) <- make.unique(locNames(gl))

That might work.

Cheers, Bernd

